# SHA-256 of each forbidden term (ADC-PRV-002), one per line, lower case,
# one to three words separated by single spaces. Only hashes are committed, so
# the terms themselves are not in the repository.
#
#   printf '%s' 'the term' | shasum -a 256
#
# This list is empty until the owner supplies the hashes. Until then the scan
# runs and finds nothing, which proves nothing about ADC-PRV-002.
